## 🛠️ How to Run This Project Locally

### 📦 1. Clone the Repository

git clone https://github.com/Nimish173/YoutubeVideoSummarizer.git
cd YoutubeVideoSummarizer

###🐍 2. Create and Activate Virtual Environment (optional but recommended)

# Create virtual env
python -m venv venv

# Activate on Windows
venv\Scripts\activate

# Activate on Mac/Linux
source venv/bin/activate

###📥 3. Install Dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

###🛠️ 4. Set the Environment Variable
Use the Service Account JSON File with google.generativeai
Assuming you have the your-key.json file stored somewhere on your PC (e.g., in the project root or a safe location), here's what you should do:
$env:GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS="C:\path\to\your-key.json"

###🧪 5. Run Your App
python app.py
